    rsXx8000PumpUnitMibModule MODULE-IDENTITY 
      LAST-UPDATED "201004270830Z"		-- April 27, 2010 at 08:30 GMT
      ORGANIZATION 
        "Rohde&Schwarz GmbH & Co. KG"
      CONTACT-INFO 
        "Torsten Huebscher
        Department 7TS2
        Broadcasting Division
        Muehldorfstrasse 15
        81671 Munich, Germany
        torsten.huebscher@rohde-schwarz.com"
      DESCRIPTION 
        "This MIB defines pump units of transmitting systems from Rohde & Schwarz.
        
        Use this MIB if your system meets the following requirements:
        - series XX8000 (NetCCU800),
        - cooling type: Liquid with R&S Pump ZK810.
        
        The following MIBs are related to this:
        - RS-COMMON-MIB         - mandatory for this MIB
        - RS-XX8000-COMMON-MIB  - mandatory for this MIB"
