        the pressure of the cooling system is to low for operation."
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitV2 39 }

    
    puOff NOTIFICATION-TYPE
      OBJECTS { eventAlarmPriority, eventAlarmClass, eventEvent, indexTransmitter, indexOst, 
        indexPumpUnit }
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION 
        "The mains to the Pump Unit is switched off for safety reasons
        (e.g. no communication to PUC and pressure fault)."
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitV2 40 }

    
    eventsPumpUnitTable OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX SEQUENCE OF EventsPumpUnitEntry
      MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "This table contains necessary information for handling alarms. 
        For each alarm you have the following information: 
        - name (get),
        - mask to enable/disable sending out (set/get),
        - priority (set/get) and 
        - the current state (get only)."
      ::= { eventPumpUnit 1 }

    
    eventsPumpUnitEntry OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX EventsPumpUnitEntry
      MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "An event entry always consists of 4 values:
        - name: an enumerated list of all possible notifications
        - mask: the corresponding mask (enable/disable)
        - priority: the corresponding priority (value in range 0..255)
        - event: the event itself (active/inactive)"
      INDEX { eventPuTxIdx, eventPuOstIdx, eventPuPumpUnitIdx, eventPuIdx }
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitTable 1 }

    
    EventsPumpUnitEntry ::=
      SEQUENCE { 
        eventPuTxIdx
          IndexTransmitter,
        eventPuOstIdx
          IndexAB,
        eventPuPumpUnitIdx
          IndexPumpUnit,
        eventPuIdx
          EventMaxEntryNumber,
        eventPuName
          INTEGER,
        eventPuMask
          EventMask,
        eventPuPriority
          EventPriority,
        eventPuEvent
          EventState
       }

    eventPuTxIdx OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX IndexTransmitter
      MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "The transmitter index in case of n+1 systems.
        If you have one transmitter only (all reserve concepts except n+1) this index is always 1."
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitEntry 1 }

    
    eventPuOstIdx OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX IndexAB
      MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "The index of the outputstage.
        If you have a transmitter with one outputstage only (SingleTx, DualDrive),
        this index is always 1."
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitEntry 2 }

    
    eventPuPumpUnitIdx OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX IndexPumpUnit
      MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "The pump unit index."
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitEntry 3 }

    
    eventPuIdx OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX EventMaxEntryNumber
      MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "The event number as index.
        This is a helper column and therefore not-accessible."
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitEntry 4 }

    
    eventPuName OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX INTEGER
        {
        puSummaryFault(1),
        puSummaryWarning(2),
        puLinked(3),
        puFan1Linked(4),
        puFan2Linked(5),
        puFan3Linked(6),
        puFan4Linked(7),
        puPump1Linked(8),
        puPump2Linked(9),
        puOn(10),
        puWarningFan1(17),
        puWarningFan2(18),
        puWarningFan3(19),
        puWarningFan4(20),
        puWarningPump1(21),
        puWarningPump2(22),
        puWarningPressure(23),
        puServiceMode(24),
        puFilterPolluted(26),
        puFaultFan1(33),
        puFaultFan2(34),
        puFaultFan3(35),
        puFaultFan4(36),
        puFaultPump1(37),
        puFaultPump2(38),
        puFaultPressure(39),
        puOff(40)
        }
      MAX-ACCESS read-only
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "The event number as integer and the value as readable text.
        The enumeration correlates with the notifications under eventsPumpUnitV2."
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitEntry 5 }

    
    eventPuMask OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX EventMask
      MAX-ACCESS read-write
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "See TextualConvention for details."
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitEntry 6 }

    
    eventPuPriority OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX EventPriority
      MAX-ACCESS read-write
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "See TextualConvention for details."
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitEntry 7 }

    
    eventPuEvent OBJECT-TYPE
      SYNTAX EventState
      MAX-ACCESS read-only
      STATUS current
      DESCRIPTION
        "See TextualConvention for details."
      ::= { eventsPumpUnitEntry 8 }

    
